          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping and tracking",
            "nav_label": "Shipping and tracking"
          }
        },
        "q-12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does delivery take?",
            "text": "All orders are processed within 1 to 3 business days. The average delivery time is 5 to 8 business days. During busy periods such as holidays or sales events, delivery may take slightly longer, and customs procedures may occasionally cause delays outside our control."
          }
        },
        "q-13": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is my tracking number?",
            "text": "<p>It's emailed as soon as the package ships – so it doesn't exist yet while we're packing your order. You can also follow it on the <a href=\"/pages/track-order\">Track my order</a> page.</p><p>Can't find the email? Check your spam folder before writing to us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-14": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My order is late. What should I do?",
            "text": "Tracking can go quiet for a few days while the package moves between carriers. That alone doesn't mean it's lost. If the expected delivery date has passed, email support@daltonpierce.com with your order number and we'll chase it up."
          }
        },
        "q-15": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I only received part of my order. Why?",
            "text": "<p>Items aren't always stored in the same place, so an order may ship in several packages, each with its own tracking number. The rest is on its way, and you don't pay extra for it.</p><p>If the last package hasn't arrived within a week of the first, write to us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-16": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tracking says delivered, but I haven't received anything.",
            "text": "Ask the people you live with and your neighbours, and check your mailbox or the nearest pickup point. If tracking confirms that the package was delivered to the address you provided, responsibility passes to the customer. If you still can't find it, email support@daltonpierce.com with your order number."
          }
        },
        "q-17": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer express delivery?",
            "text": "Not at the moment. All orders ship with tracked standard delivery, so we can't promise a specific date. If you have a deadline, allow 1–3 business days for processing plus 5–8 business days for delivery."
          }
        },
        "q-18": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you ship, and do I pay duties?",
            "text": "We ship to addresses in Canada. Orders are shipped internationally, so customs procedures may apply on arrival, and delays due to customs are outside our control. If you have a question about import charges, email support@daltonpierce.com before you order."
          }
        },
        "q-19": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which carriers do you use?",
            "text": "<p>We use established carriers – including Canada Post, UPS, FedEx and DHL, depending on the destination – so your package arrives safely and on time.</p>"
          }
        },
