        "q-21": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel my order?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, as long as it hasn't shipped. Email <a href=\"mailto:support@daltonpierce.com\">support@daltonpierce.com</a> with your order number as soon as possible – there's a short window before the order goes to the warehouse.</p><p>Once it has shipped, the quickest option is to accept the package and send it back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-22": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I change the shipping address?",
            "text": "Email support@daltonpierce.com within 24 hours of placing your order. An incorrect shipping address entered at checkout is the customer's responsibility. Carriers can't redirect a package once it's in their system."
          }
        },
        "q-23": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I ordered something by mistake. Can you remove it?",
            "text": "<p>If the order hasn't shipped, yes – tell us which item and we'll remove it and refund that part. If it has shipped, it goes through the normal return process.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-24": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will a sold-out size come back?",
            "text": "<p>Sometimes, but we can't promise – it depends on what our makers can produce. We don't have back-in-stock alerts right now, so the newsletter is the best way to hear when a line returns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q-25": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I paid but didn't get a confirmation email.",
            "text": "<p>First check your spam folder, then the email address you entered at checkout – a single wrong character is the usual cause.</p><p>Still missing? Email <a href=\"mailto:support@daltonpierce.com\">support@daltonpierce.com</a> with the name and address you ordered under, and we'll resend it. A missing email doesn't mean the order went wrong.</p>"
          }
        },
