            "text": "<p>Follow the care label in the garment – it takes priority over any general advice.</p><p>As a rule of thumb: wash at 30°C on a gentle cycle, turn prints and dark colours inside out, skip the dryer, and dry knits flat rather than on a hanger.</p>"
